{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Flows\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Flows\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Flows\/SQ","doc:\/\/Flows\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Flows\/SH","doc:\/\/Flows\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Flows\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EdmondsKarpEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Capacity"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each round a breadth-first search over the residual network, its rows in edge-position order,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finds a shortest augmenting path from the source to the sink, stopping when the sink is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discovered. The path is reported with its bottleneck, the smallest residual along it; then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bottleneck is sent along it one edge at a time, from the source end: pushed along an edge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"room to spare, or cancelled on an edge whose flow the path runs against. When the sink cannot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be reached the flow is maximum and nothing more is reported."}]}],"kind":"content